{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40503","headline":"西施 · 苏拯","name":"西施","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吴王从骄佚，天产西施出。\n岂徒伐一人，所希救羣物。\n良由上天意，恶盈戒奢侈。\n不独破吴国，不独生越水。\n在周名襃姒，在纣名妲己。\n变化本多涂，生杀亦如此。\n君王政不修，立地生西子。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏拯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40503.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40503","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}